      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk... the hotlines and therapists just feel like more noise. more people trying to fix something that doesn't feel broken, just... hollow. it's like they want to keep me in this gray loop forever. i just find myself wondering if there's even a version of this where things actually change, or if this is just how it is now. i just want to feel like i'm not just waiting around for nothing.",
